std::map (sorted by key, O(log n) lookup)
  brown : 1
  dog : 1
  fox : 2
  jumps : 1
  lazy : 1
  over : 1
  quick : 1
  the : 3

unordered_map lookup of "fox": 2 (O(1) expected)
buckets: 13
```

